Third-party software bundled with ICF-kanban
============================================

The built files panel/main.js and service/main.js include code from the package
below. build/cli/task-board.mjs includes no third-party code.

@openchamber/sdk's own dependency zod is not included: the parts of the SDK that
use it are not bundled (checked with an esbuild metafile of each entry).

